# Fast pre-commit gate only (RFC-008 Decision 9): format + lint changed files,
# then a project-wide typecheck (Turborepo-cached, so ~instant on a warm cache).
# The heavy stages (tests, e2e, bundle budget) run via `npm run ci`, not here —
# keeping commits quick. See README "Local validation (no remote)".
#
# set -e: without it, a failing lint-staged still lets the hook exit 0 off
# npm run typecheck's status, silently letting a bad commit through.
set -e
npx lint-staged
npm run typecheck
